      "algebraic_reason": "For compact-q-dilog Φ_q(z) = ∏_{k≥0}(1-q^{2k+1}z)^{-1}, the series log Φ_q(z) = Σ z^n/n · q^n/(1-q^{2n}). Setting q → q⁻¹ flips sign of EACH term: q^-n/(1-q^-{2n}) = -q^n/(1-q^{2n}). Therefore log Φ_{q⁻¹}(z) = -log Φ_q(z), and the SUM is identically zero. The .md's claimed 'algebraic identity' q^n/(1-q^{2n}) + q^-n/(1-q^-{2n}) = -1/(q^n-q^-n) is an arithmetic error — the correct value is 0.",
